    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_STARMETAL_METEOR_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once a game: a meteor falls on a land plot you see, not a peak, within 6 plots of your borders, with no city, improvement, unit or resource.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The plot loses its feature and gains Mithril (revealed and connected with Mithril Working).",
